{"version":1,"key":"article:39","content":{"id":39,"title":"信号的相关","author":"","content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8de36104-dc3f-4bf4-9a55-fef783685f79","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有时候需要将一个信号与多个参考信号进行比较，以便确定每对信号之间的相似性，从而从相似性中提取出额外的信息。在雷达应用中，接收到的信号是目标反射回来的信号，该信号是反射信号的延迟形式，通过测量延迟，可以确定目标的位置。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"83b08570-c49b-4e09-a124-0d5988b49352","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"从向量的内积谈起"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"33cf9081-8f94-4a60-89df-e754a560cab6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"按照一般教科书的写法，一般会直接给出一个互相关的公式，比如两个能量信号序列的相关性的度量可以定义为"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"r_{xy}[l]=\\sum_{n=-\\infty}^{\\infty}x[n]y[n-l]","collabId":"f2f709ac-0ea9-409a-829b-0512352ae92c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a281fd59-e2fb-4a72-8604-fc9809d8c4a5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"先不解释这个公式的组成以及含义，但是我学习这个的时候一直想，为什么这个公式能够给出两个信号之间的相关性的度量。所以我打算从向量的内积开始，从向量的内积讲到这个公式，不过由于接下来的都是我的理解，我在数字信号处理的教材中还没有看到相关的介绍(可能是我读书少)，所以接下来的数学推导并不是很准确(事实上涉及的数学推导几乎没有)，重点是这种思想的理解。首先考虑两个向量，这两个向量的模长都是固定的，那么怎么描述两个向量之间的相关程度，在我看来，二者之间的夹角大小可以描述这种相关性，如果两个向量相关性高，说明两向量之间的夹角比较小，根据向量的内积"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"\\vec{a} \\cdot \\vec{b}=\\vert a \\vert \\vert b \\vert cos\\phi","collabId":"516cf30c-4571-46eb-9e1c-ee22dc8071e4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1cb96428-68fb-4f0f-ab02-a9d4a8da2425","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"其中 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"\\phi","collabId":"0534fef0-5f32-4a32-b90a-929973949a45","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"\\phi"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为向量 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"\\vec{a}","collabId":"4dc77b32-5bf2-4d96-a62b-1c604bdc3f32","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"\\vec{a}"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 与向量 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"\\vec{b}","collabId":"eec1a321-d563-46c6-b0f9-fc146d74aded","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"\\vec{b}"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 之间的夹角，如果两个向量相关性越高，那么二者之间的夹角越小，所以 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"cos\\phi","collabId":"80eedd88-8df7-48c4-85b2-9bf359015a33","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"cos\\phi"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 越大，由于向量的模长固定，所以相关性越高也就代表着两向量的内积越大。如果用坐标形式表示，假设两个向量都是二维向量，那么向量的内积可以表示为"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"\\vec{a} \\cdot \\vec{b}=x_ax_b+y_ay_b","collabId":"38e3a414-9d4b-48e6-91d0-1edd60c015d7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"570cfd06-b138-4681-8ec3-ef1b55928de1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"虽然我这里用的二维向量，但是明显可以推广到无限维的情况。那么接下来我们在来看之前在文章开头定义的那个公式"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"r_{xy}[l]=\\sum_{n=-\\infty}^{\\infty}x[n]y[n-l]","collabId":"3647a5fa-54f6-4405-aa7b-be565baecc8f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"779207fd-06ef-425d-b17a-7337dc9c89de","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于序列 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"x[n]","collabId":"72d12ea0-cb4c-4686-82e7-a94bf1fb9b0b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"x[n]"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和序列 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"y[n-l]","collabId":"5123a079-cb5e-4abd-b9b9-1993087c70d0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"y[n-l]"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以看做是一个无限维的向量，而"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"x[-\\infty], ..., x[0], ..., x[\\infty]","collabId":"9aec049a-c769-479f-a81f-e0ea7001d233","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2167e34d-2890-4090-9d2b-7b1ee303545e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以看做是向量 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"x[n]","collabId":"ebfe157d-f363-41a1-8e11-4af7d0af5652","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"x[n]"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" (这里我把 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"x[n]","collabId":"155e2478-d54c-4314-9538-d2dff9cf525c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"x[n]"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 看做是一个向量了)的坐标，相应的"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"y[-\\infty], ..., y[-l], ... y[\\infty]","collabId":"28e718e9-10d0-4f95-9a2b-92d2d1f431ee","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5e7fa940-9ca3-4a38-abba-b274c5166ba1","children":