都是不变的(不论序列 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"y[n]","collabId":"cb0236aa-2569-4416-9782-26c180e8b388","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"y[n]"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是有限长还是无限长)，符合我们推导时做的假设，所以在这里我从向量的内积这个方面解释了为什么这个公式可以表示两个信号的相关性程度。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"656ea38a-8c63-4d8c-b2b0-aeab77b9632f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"定义"}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"44961684-a581-4c13-99c2-0e01cb3b4378","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"互相关"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"75fb31b9-6765-4890-9e31-f2ff5b0ea8e2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面从向量内积的角度理解了互相关公式，接下来将按照教科书上给出严格的定义。互相关序列"},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"r_{xy}[l]","collabId":"c83be07b-5abf-4c1a-b863-0a97a287508f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"r_{xy}[l]"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"表示一对"},{"type":"formatted","color":"#e33a32","darkColor":"#fa7873","text":"能量序列 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"x[n]","collabId":"3ca37c65-6f91-4ba8-92f6-e43ad83f5130","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"x[n]"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"y[n]","collabId":"48c0e5b1-8419-44fe-a627-7e90bef056ce","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"y[n]"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"之间相似性的度量，其定义为(假设式中的无限求和是收敛的)"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"r_{xy}[l]=\\sum_{n=-\\infty}^{\\infty}x[n]y[n-l]","collabId":"6813b9f2-4275-4404-834b-a8387ad7955d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"20443322-d03e-4f6b-9c43-819b47f4da1a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"式中，"},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"r_{xy}[l]","collabId":"8ae711f2-f1c8-4068-8085-5fbbb5f4ed31","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"r_{xy}[l]"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 代表了序列 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"x[n]","collabId":"924763cc-0483-4e3c-a6b9-d2b9def78630","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"x[n]"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 与序列 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"y[n-l]","collabId":"a37167c7-40c5-492f-93f0-3450fbbdf831","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"y[n-l]"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 之间的相关性程度，所以 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"r_{xy}[l]","collabId":"96a11fb1-2297-434a-a337-3a6f7c1ab447","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"r_{xy}[l]"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 越大，代表序列 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"x[n]","collabId":"8f81526e-914a-4ec1-9a84-e837a2404fe6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"x[n]"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 与序列 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"y[n-l]","collabId":"cc5153ab-2496-4f8f-b3d7-5d5d7330878d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"y[n-l]"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的相似性越高。"}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"9c0a8f10-5f9e-4947-94c4-bb384743b6a5","ch